      "content": "yeah exactly, it feels like \"accountability\" is just the word they use when it suits them. if the result is always just making regular people suffer while the leaders stay in power, isn't it more accurate to just call sanctions a failed or even immoral policy? like, if they don't actually achieve the \"democracy\" part, why shouldn't we just stop pretending they're a legitimate tool and call them what they are: economic bullying?",
